WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two numbers cross the screen. The first is reported.
The second sometimes goes missing from the answer.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Psychologists call this an attentional blink.
Targets, timing, and distractors matter.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Missing a target is not your eyes shutting.
A quick clip cannot diagnose you.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Changing an experiment can change the effect.
The true story isn't a magic blackout.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Meditation research also studies attention.
It doesn't prove a retail audio works.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the source. Try the free twelve-minute log.
Then decide whether audio fits your needs.
